<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ vehicle registrations fall in December.</title>
<headline>NZ vehicle registrations fall in December.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total number of car registrations in New Zealand fell to 21,113 in December from 22,870 in November, the Land Transport and Safety Authority said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They were up from 20,751 in December 1995.</p>
<p>New and ex-overseas car registrations fell to 18,469 from 20,927 in November and 18,296 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
